GIMP Palette
Name: Platformer — Sunset Ruins
Columns: 6
#
# Direction: late afternoon on a collapsed aqueduct. Warm, low sun, long
# shadows, green reclaiming the stonework.
#
# The first thirteen entries are assets/palette.gpl unchanged, and that is
# load-bearing rather than sentimental: the hero's four frames are already
# painted in them and committed. A per-game palette that recoloured the hero
# would have made the move from one palette to nine look like a redesign, and
# then nobody could tell which changes were the point.
#
# Everything below accent-rust is new, and all of it is scenery — the sky the
# hero stands against, the stone he stands on, the growth in between. The cast
# keeps its old colours; only the world it lives in got built.
#
